#: source/language/variables.md:1
msgid "Variables"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/variables.md:3
msgid "A _variable_ is an [identifier](identifiers.md) used as an expression."
msgstr ""

#: source/language/variables.md:5
msgid "**Syntax**"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/variables.md:7
msgid "_expression_ → _identifier_"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/variables.md:9
msgid ""
"A variable must have the same name as a definition in the [scope](./"
"scope.md) that encloses it. The value of a variable is the value of the "
"corresponding expression in the enclosing scope."
msgstr ""
